    "text": "21alivenews.com\nwebsite\nFort Wayne\nRoad closure coming to Fort Wayne’s northeast side\nBy WPTA Staff,\n6 hours agoFORT WAYNE, Ind. (WPTA) - A road closure is coming to Fort Wayne’s northeast side. According to Fort Wayne City Utilities, Lahmeyer Road between Trier Road and East State Boulevard will be closed beginning Thursday, July 3 as crews install a new 12-inch diameter feeder main. The department says...\n4",
